OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 54-bed mental health
OL,4,Ahospital  approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mental health hospital with more than
OL,7,F50 beds is set to be built near a
OL,8,Fprimary school despite more than 200
OL,9,Fobjections from the public questioning
OL,10,Fthe suitability of its location.
OL,12,FExeter City Council first gave planning
OL,13,Fpermission for the Cygnet Health Care
OL,14,Funit in the Birchy Barton area in 2018
OL,15,Fbut no building work has taken place on
OL,16,Fthe field near St Nicholas Primary
OL,17,FSchool.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
