OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 54-bed mental health
OL,4,Ahospital  approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has now approved some
OL,7,Falterations to the original plans and
OL,8,Fsaid building must start within three
OL,9,Fyears, according to the Local Democracy
OL,10,FReporting Service (LDRS).
OL,12,FIn its application, Cygnet said there
OL,13,Fwas a growing need for mental health
OL,14,Fcare facilities in the area.
